title: "Pixel Arcade"
abstract: "Pixel Arcade is a collection of 300 classic browser games — word puzzles, logic, arcade, strategy, and quiz — built with pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No build step, no backend, no dependencies. Perfect for GitHub Pages hosting and offline play."
